        "description": "Urinary urgency or incontinence",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive lower limb spasticity, thin corpus callosum on MRI, and biallelic pathogenic variants in C12orf65 gene",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires genetic confirmation due to phenotypic overlap with other hereditary spastic paraplegias"
